### Terminal Benchmarks
**Source:** OpenAI internal benchmarks
**Snapshot:** September 2026

- Terminal-Bench-Science 0.1 (maximum reasoning effort): More than double GPT-6 Sol's score (verified)
- GPT-6 Sol: No verified public score found
