## Use Cases

### Best For:
- Complex, long-running agentic coding workflows (multi-hour coding sessions)
- Software engineering and software development
- Enterprise applications requiring strong coding capabilities
- Organizations heavily invested in OpenAI ecosystem
- Cost-sensitive applications with good prompt caching strategies
- Multimodal applications requiring vision capabilities
- Organizations seeking cost-effective frontier-level performance
- Research-grade tasks requiring near-Astra intelligence
- Computer use and tool-assisted workflows

### Not Ideal For:
- Organizations outside OpenAI ecosystem
- Applications requiring frontier-level performance (GPT-6 Astra is more capable)
- Organizations with strict data sovereignty requirements
- Real-time applications requiring ultra-low latency
- General-purpose applications (better suited for GPT-5.5 or GPT-5.6 Sol)
- Organizations requiring maximum accuracy for critical tasks (GPT-6 Astra is more capable)

